1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,330
(Official:)Is that the song
from Toy Story?

2
00:00:02,399 --> 00:00:03,399
(Penny:)He loves that movie.

3
00:00:03,466 --> 00:00:04,906
(voice breaking):
I do.

4
00:00:07,171 --> 00:00:09,871
(Bernadette:)Aw, that was beautiful.
Yeah.

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,810
(Howard:)I mean, not like our
wedding beautiful.

6
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:14,515
(Bernadette:)No, we totally won.

7
00:00:14,578 --> 00:00:17,378
(Sheldon:)Amy, I don't understand,
are we broken up or not?

8
00:00:17,446 --> 00:00:18,976
(Sheldon:)It's like you can't
make up your mind.

9
00:00:19,048 --> 00:00:22,048
(Amy:)It's because you're not
giving me any space to think.

10
00:00:22,118 --> 00:00:23,348
(Sheldon:)Well, you should think fast,

11
00:00:23,419 --> 00:00:25,819
(Sheldon:)because men can sire offspring
their entire lives,

12
00:00:25,888 --> 00:00:28,958
(Sheldon:)but those eggs you're toting
around have a sell-by date.

13
00:00:32,729 --> 00:00:35,499
(Amy:)You know what, Sheldon,
you've made this really easy.

14
00:00:35,564 --> 00:00:38,864
(Amy:)You're immature, you're selfish,
you just insulted me to my face.

15
00:00:38,935 --> 00:00:41,235
(Amy:)I don't need any more time
to think. We're broken up.

16
00:00:41,303 --> 00:00:42,473
(Sheldon:)Amy...

17
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,340
(Sheldon:)Will someone take me home?

18
00:00:46,408 --> 00:00:47,438
(Raj:)Yeah. Come on,
I'll give you a ride.

19
00:00:47,509 --> 00:00:50,209
MINISTER:
...symbolizes your eternal love.

20
00:00:50,279 --> 00:00:53,849
I now pronounce you
husband and wife.

21
00:00:55,817 --> 00:00:56,647
We did it!

22
00:00:56,719 --> 00:01:00,359
(Leonard:)I'm so glad
you guys could watch!

